OL,3,ACleveland police chief proud of force
OL,4,Abut being 'let down' by funding
OL,5,
OL,6,FCleveland Police's Chief Constable has
OL,7,Fsaid she is proud of her "brave" force
OL,8,Fbut that it was being "let down" by the
OL,9,Fway it was funded, following a fatal
OL,10,Fcrash which killed seven people
OL,11,Fincluding two police officers.
OL,13,FIn her first sit-down interview since
OL,14,Fthe A66 crash, speaking exclusively to
OL,15,Fthe BBC, Victoria Fuller said the force
OL,16,Fneeded to become part of a larger force
OL,17,Fwith greater resources.
OL,23,APub: 04-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG7/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,305,300,200,140,0,100
PN,11908
SC,0008
CT,25,T
PS,c000
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F119A1788617889
OL,1,W5j 5Q7kjs15j 5ws
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,ACleveland police chief proud of force
OL,4,Abut being 'let down' by funding
OL,5,
OL,6,FShe said her officers are dealing with
OL,7,Fsome of the highest crime levels in the
OL,8,Fcountry akin to those faced by
OL,9,Fmetropolitan forces, but with less than
OL,10,Fhalf the number of officers.
OL,12,FMultiple people have since been
OL,13,Farrested as part of a wider police
OL,14,Foperation against organised crime
OL,15,Ffollowing the crash.
OL,23,APub: 04-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG8/39
